# A deusex:// link handed over while a text is edited (bugs.md LUI.8): the
# page stays until the edit is kept, then Multiplayer asks about the link's
# server. test_ui_scripts.c hands the link over from a second start 8 s in
# and finds the name kept in User.ini.
wait 1.5
expect home
find Settings
key Return
wait 0.5
expect settings
find Multiplayer
key Return
wait 0.3
find Your name
key Return
wait 0.2
key Backspace *40
type Waited
wait 8
expect settings Multiplayer
key Return
wait 0.5
expect confirm
find Not now
key Return
wait 0.3
expect multiplayer
quit
